flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Reset processor]
    B --> C[PC = 0]
    C --> D[Fetch instruction from instruction memory]
    D --> E[Decode instruction fields]
    E --> F[Generate control signals]
    F --> G[Generate immediate value]
    G --> H[Read register values rs1 and rs2]
    H --> I{alu_src = 1?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Use immediate as ALU input 2]
    I -- No --> K[Use read_data2 as ALU input 2]
    J --> L[Perform ALU operation]
    K --> L
    L --> M{Instruction type}
    M -- lw --> N[Read data memory]
    N --> O[Write memory data to rd]
    M -- sw --> P[Write read_data2 to data memory]
    P --> Q[PC = PC + 4]
    M -- beq --> R{zero = 1?}
    R -- Yes --> S[PC = branch target]
    R -- No --> Q
    M -- R-type --> T[Write ALU result to rd]
    M -- addi --> T
    O --> Q
    T --> Q
    S --> U[Next instruction]
    Q --> U[Next instruction]
    U --> D
